[?2004l[?2004h>             temp1, temp2 = temps[i], temps[i+1]
[?2004l[?2004h>             
[?2004l[?2004h>             # Check if this segment is in preheat
[?2004l[?2004h>             # We assume preheat is the phase where temp is rising from ambient to soak/reflow.
[?2004l[?2004h>             # The handbook says "preheat section... temperatures generally between 100C to 150C".
